Sensirion BLE (DIY gadgets) for Home Assistant

This integration is a modified copy of the "sensirion_ble" integration of
Home Assistant Core (https://github.com/home-assistant/core, Apache License
2.0, Copyright Home Assistant Core contributors) and of the parser of the
sensirion-ble library (https://github.com/akx/sensirion-ble).

Changes: the advertisement parser was replaced by a table-driven one that
covers the live-data sample types published by Sensirion at
https://sensirion.github.io/ble-services/, and the sensor platform gained
entities for VOC index, NOx index, formaldehyde and particulate matter.
